# Tracking work: the Arlesh board

Work is tracked as Agentic Tasks under the ARLESH project on the user's Arlesh board, through the
`Arlesh` MCP server (`.mcp.json`, `http://127.0.0.1:4747/mcp` by default). See the
"Tracking work: the Arlesh board" section of `AGENTS.md` for the command map and the rules —
above all: never create a Task or set a priority without the user's approval, and never fall
back to `bd` (`.beads/` is a read-only archive).
